# Google AdSense
# 1. Create an account at https://adsense.google.com
# 2. Add this site's URL and wait for approval
# 3. Copy your Publisher ID (format: ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX) here
# 4. Copy this file to .env and fill in the real value
# 5. Once you create ad units in AdSense, put their slot IDs into the
#    <AdSlot slot="..."> calls in src/pages/*.tsx
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=
